    {
      "id": "liu-shao-song-confine-princely-children",
      "title": "拘禁刘子业及义宣诸子",
      "summary": "刘劭拘守刘骏之子刘子业于侍中下省，拘刘义宣诸子于太仓空屋，并命刘濬写信向刘骏提及子业。",
      "year": 453,
      "precision": "year",
      "phase": "rule",
      "sortOrder": 16,
      "sourceDate": "太初元年刘骏起兵入讨时，未独记月日",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p19",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c2fe74157c8ca145dd0355a72eec53341b1825cbfb661d1f217e469d0b1f6ac4",
          "excerpt": "防守世祖子於侍中下省，南譙王義宣諸子於太倉空屋。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p19",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "c2fe74157c8ca145dd0355a72eec53341b1825cbfb661d1f217e469d0b1f6ac4",
          "excerpt": "劭使濬與世祖書曰："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "nanshi-v002",
          "paragraphId": "nanshi-v002-p276",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "da367bcf8d5f62be7ff0a8dd2a0e7c48171f202145740bf198e0d3c025858e87",
          "excerpt": "三十年，孝武入伐，元凶囚帝于侍中下省，將加害者數矣，卒得無恙。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "《南史》前废帝传称多次拟加害，最终无恙，不能写成已被杀。书信中厚待等语为威胁语境下自陈，不直接当作待遇事实。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-shao-song-withdraw-family-killing-plan",
      "title": "听劝撤去杀三镇家属之议",
      "summary": "刘劭欲杀起兵三镇士民的家眷，经刘义恭、何尚之劝说，改下书一概不问。",
      "year": 453,
      "precision": "year",
      "phase": "rule",
      "sortOrder": 17,
      "sourceDate": "太初元年诸镇起兵后，未独记月日",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "2fbaf4b221591ec836bcd6c13b647784b018e2b86d3f632c8cc6486e29ddb9de",
          "excerpt": "劭欲殺三鎮士庶家口，江夏王義恭、何尚之說之曰："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "2fbaf4b221591ec836bcd6c13b647784b018e2b86d3f632c8cc6486e29ddb9de",
          "excerpt": "劭謂為然，乃下書一無所問。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "nanshi-v014",
          "paragraphId": "nanshi-v014-p17",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "676b04985bd51aa9e37906863e88de6ed933a36606427153c1baf7ce050585aa",
          "excerpt": "劭乃下書，一無所問。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "欲杀、劝止和实际撤议分开，不称已诛三镇家属。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-shao-song-reject-naval-plan",
      "title": "拒水军上决，委兵王罗汉与鲁秀",
      "summary": "刘濬、萧斌劝率水军上游决战或据梁山，刘劭采刘义恭就近待敌之策，不纳萧斌之言；他又疑旧臣不肯效力，转而把兵事委给王罗汉、鲁秀。",
      "year": 453,
      "precision": "year",
      "phase": "rule",
      "sortOrder": 18,
      "sourceDate": "太初元年战前议策，未独记月日",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "2fbaf4b221591ec836bcd6c13b647784b018e2b86d3f632c8cc6486e29ddb9de",
          "excerpt": "濬及蕭斌勸劭勒水軍自上決戰，若不爾，則保據梁山。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p20",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "2fbaf4b221591ec836bcd6c13b647784b018e2b86d3f632c8cc6486e29ddb9de",
          "excerpt": "劭不納。疑朝廷舊臣悉不為己用，厚接王羅漢、魯秀，悉以兵事委之，"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "建议与实际出兵分开，不写刘劭已率水军赴梁山。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-shao-song-inspect-fleet-and-relocate",
      "title": "督修船舰，迁南岸百姓",
      "summary": "刘劭每日出行军中慰劳将士，亲督都水整治船舰，又焚南岸、驱百姓各家渡水北。",
      "year": 453,
