          "excerpt": "二十五日，義恭單馬南奔，"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p22",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "63bab1f650df0e4d5ad06ad66ae39a35c1df32e471d07498735fcd7b25cae1fd",
          "excerpt": "遣濬殺義恭諸子。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "songshu-v099",
          "paragraphId": "songshu-v099-p34",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "aff719a2152ca3ab0e9fb505fbb8d6db1c0fa46efe87b920b1d0ac4d060bb2e3",
          "excerpt": "義恭詰劭曰：「我背逆歸順，有何大罪，頓殺我家十二兒？」劭答曰：「殺諸弟，此事負阿父。」"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "二十五日明系义恭逃离，不自动用作杀子确日；命令者为刘劭、执行者为刘濬，阿父此处指叔父义恭。"
      ]
    },
